  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "GraphViewportComponent is the primary presentation layer for rendering an interactive 3D graph visualization using the 3d-force-graph library. It manages the complex physics simulation, translating abstract graph state (nodes, links, selection) into dynamic visual elements. It subscribes to state services to handle visual updates, including smooth fading transitions managed via requestAnimationFrame. It exposes methods to control the 3D camera view and convert world coordinates to screen coordinates."
  },
